SUMMARY:Alpine Investors Info Session
LOCATION:Robertson Hall Room 002
DESCRIPTION:Curious about buying and building best-in-class businesses? J
 oin Alpine Investors for an interactive information session to learn mor
 e about private equity career opportunities and some interviewing tips a
 nd tricks. This is a chance to get an inside look at how a leading firm 
 thinks about investing\, interact with investing team members\, and lear
 n more about their internship program. The summer 2028 investing interns
 hip is for current sophomores\, but all grad years are encouraged to att
 end the event. Alpine is also still accepting applications from current 
 juniors for its summer 2027 investing internship. Register on Handshake 
 first\, then RSVP using Alpine Investors' form Link downloads document (
