 rk and career paths available at AlphaSights - The opportunity to ask qu
 estions and connect with the AlphaSights team In addition to learning ab
 out the firm and its culture\, students are encouraged to explore curren
 t opportunities available at AlphaSights. These roles provide an excelle
 nt pathway into client service\, commercial problem-solving\, and profes
