SUMMARY:NYU Law School Visit
LOCATION:Frist Campus Center 302
DESCRIPTION:Join a New York University School of Law representative who w
 ill share in-depth information about their school and what current and f
 uture applicants should consider when applying. This is an opportunity t
 o learn about NYU Law clinics\, curriculum and admission criteria. This 
 program is open to all Princeton University undergraduate and graduate s
 tudents regardless of identity. Email [careerdevelopment@princeton.edu](
 mailto:careerdevelopment@princeton.edu) to request accommodations at lea
